#: src/postulo/plugins/europass/credential.py
msgid "That is a European Digital Credential in the old XML format, which Postulo does not read. Download it again from your Europass wallet, where it has been converted, and upload that file."
msgstr ""

#: src/postulo/plugins/europass/reader.py
#, fuzzy
msgid "That is not a Europass file. Postulo reads the PDF europass.europa.eu gives you, the XML attached to it, and the older Europass XML and JSON; this is none of them."
msgstr "Hii sio rekodi ya Ulaya. Postulo inasoma PDF Europass.europa.eu inakupa, XML imeshikamana nayo, na wazee wa Europas XML na JSON; hii sio moja yao."

#: src/postulo/plugins/europass/credential.py
msgid "That is not a European Digital Credential Postulo can read. It reads the JSON-LD the Europass wallet gives you, sealed or not."
msgstr ""

#: src/postulo/plugins/europass/reader.py
#, fuzzy
msgid "That PDF has files attached to it, and none of them is a Europass CV. Upload the PDF europass.europa.eu gives you, as it is."
msgstr "PDF hiyo ina faili zilizoshikamana nayo, na hakuna hata mmoja wao ni CV ya Europass. Pakia europass.europa.eu inakupa, kama ilivyo."

#: src/postulo/plugins/europass/reader.py
#, fuzzy
msgid "That PDF has nothing attached to it, so there is no Europass CV inside it to read. The PDF europass.europa.eu gives you carries the CV as an attached file, and a PDF printed or saved again by another program loses it: download the CV again from europass.europa.eu and upload that file as it is."
msgstr "PDF hiyo haina chochote cha kushikamana nayo, kwa hivyo hakuna CV ya Ulaya ndani yake kusoma. Europass.europa.eu inakupa hubeba CV kama faili iliyoambatanishwa, na PDF iliyochapishwa au kuokolewa tena na programu nyingine inapoteza: Pakua CV tena kutoka europass.europa.eu na kupakia faili hiyo kama ilivyo."

#: src/postulo/plugins/europass/reader.py
#, fuzzy
msgid "That PDF is encrypted, so the Europass CV attached to it cannot be read. Download the CV again from europass.europa.eu and upload that file as it is."
msgstr "PDF hiyo imefichwa, kwa hivyo CV ya Europas haiwezi kusomwa. Pakua CV tena kutoka europass.europa.eu na upakia faili hiyo kama ilivyo."

#: src/postulo/plugins/europass/reader.py
#, fuzzy
msgid "That XML is not a Europass CV. Postulo reads the XML europass.europa.eu writes (a Candidate) and that of the Europass editor before it (a SkillsPassport); this is neither."
msgstr "XML sio CV ya Ulaya. Postulo inasoma XML europass.europa.eu anaandika (Mgombea) na ile ya mhariri wa Europass kabla yake (S SkillsPassport); hii sio."

#: src/postulo/plugins/europass/__init__.py
msgid "The European CV format: the PDF europass.europa.eu gives you and the XML attached to it, and the older XML and JSON of the Europass service before it. Also reads what a European Digital Credential you keep under Files states."
msgstr ""

#: src/postulo/plugins/europass/reader.py
#, fuzzy
msgid "The file attached to that PDF is damaged and could not be unpacked. Download the CV again from europass.europa.eu and upload that file as it is."
msgstr "Faili iliyoambatanishwa na PDF hiyo imeharibiwa na haiwezi kufungwa. Pakua CV tena kutoka europass.europa.eu na upakia faili hiyo kama ilivyo."

#: src/postulo/plugins/europass/reader.py
#, fuzzy, python-format
msgid "The file attached to that PDF is packed in a way Postulo does not read (%(filter)s). Download the CV again from europass.europa.eu and upload that file as it is."
msgstr "Faili lililoambatishwa kwenye PDF hiyo limefungwa kwa namna ambayo Postulo haisomi (%(filter)s). Pakua CV tena kutoka europass.europa.eu na upakie faili hilo kama lilivyo."

#: src/postulo/plugins/europass/reader.py
#, fuzzy, python-format
msgid "The file attached to that PDF unpacks to more than %(limit)s MB, so it was not read."
msgstr "Faili lililoambatishwa kwenye PDF hiyo linafunguka kuwa zaidi ya MB %(limit)s, kwa hiyo halikusomwa."

#: src/postulo/plugins/europass/candidate.py
#, fuzzy
msgid "The file holds this career in more than one language, and only the first was read."
msgstr "Faili inashikilia kazi hii katika lugha zaidi ya moja, na ya kwanza tu ilisomwa."

